#: omake:omake_8F3B5A95_060E_4BAC_972A_F08911B67416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f6da58f2ba483ffb73816da4e92aa906774dc72cc2205d6e5e6b83b7cf581f6
#. default-sha256: 0e5dd3daa33d0d1145281c5444e551340ea6278fa59b46997cc84b9f1521b859
msgctxt "omake:omake_8F3B5A95_060E_4BAC_972A_F08911B67416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The fact that you’re here means you’ve uncovered all the mansion’s mysteries, yes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫既然来到这里，⟪k:2⟫说明你已经解开了洋馆之谜吧？"

#: omake:omake_33DB8421_3078_4DDB_BCC8_CC85C82A31C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d6f459b1dd182b198d151ecc9501909b5e854338ee4de5c9affa00f531bdedd
#. default-sha256: 6f97df119da1cb3dc8efa5f27958a34aada436d4417809cbf5321cc71e06c227
msgctxt "omake:omake_33DB8421_3078_4DDB_BCC8_CC85C82A31C9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫My congratulations for having the fortitude to endure such a... ⟪k:3⟫grim "
"tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……呵呵……⟪k:2⟫值得夸奖。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫至少你有足够的耐力，⟪k:5⟫读完这悲惨的故事。"

#: omake:omake_D63F2895_E50C_46E2_9865_90EE7DAEF191
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00a50cca02f5bd7e4a2a6110ff78ee53380e4497bd3580ed9c33ae6e85d6b0df
#. default-sha256: de3486ecd3d9d4b9d10a11fbe25e5e55895ed24b40a8a88a5282a32cbce57ffc
msgctxt "omake:omake_D63F2895_E50C_46E2_9865_90EE7DAEF191"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is, if you’re willing to take this hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫前提是，⟪k:3⟫你要抓住这只化为枯骨的手。"

#: omake:omake_A617AD89_AEC1_4805_99EF_AA6B38AE5A1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c90e1442b1da01aa21ce428c3f3eff7ee49153ac89fd21facb79d15bde2ad645
#. default-sha256: a250f4ad39db519e5b9661c01ba6670e0f0e00f3939781f8574a33cf58c2fe4e
msgctxt "omake:omake_A617AD89_AEC1_4805_99EF_AA6B38AE5A1E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That said, I would prefer not to have to guide you around the house all by myself. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Not because I have anything in particular against you, of course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫话说回来，⟪k:2⟫我不想和你单独在洋馆之中走动。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫说实话，⟪k:5⟫并不是讨厌你。"

#: omake:omake_DA265B35_DB52_473A_9DE9_B33FBA039094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a63e67222ecfdce5d47b58b4f07696360923173f8db60fa9c23fb56fb17f4f3
#. default-sha256: 03111f43e7f55231140225bb0203ccbcb6d476a6d87ea5b16376b76576c4fc76
msgctxt "omake:omake_DA265B35_DB52_473A_9DE9_B33FBA039094"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I simply think it would be inappropriate for him not to accompany us—⟪k:2⟫yes, him. "
"This story’s protagonist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫果然这里……⟪k:2⟫应该让他也一起来吧？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫没错，⟪k:5⟫就是这部作品的……「主角」。"

#: omake:omake_0794DE9D_FE35_4A86_8F75_5AD32CE22656
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e0bcbc06e62294c4b5ddbbbb0d1534619020c5139128c304d0b0ee78b78fa65
#. default-sha256: ca2a6b8572ae7bb0a76b1d234bd506d64c6c2b09f21fb28d46b438d84f403b1e
msgctxt "omake:omake_0794DE9D_FE35_4A86_8F75_5AD32CE22656"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫D-⟪k:2⟫Don’t worry! When I was in her position, I closed my eyes and plugged my ears "
"when you were doing your business!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫啊，⟪k:2⟫没事的！⟪k:3⟫我那个时候有好好地闭眼捂耳朵！"

#: omake:omake_C86A283F_EF5F_4910_9E27_FEEE835E9822
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b37b08af5d0dab651743c11df0885ab2088c1822c1f38b55e31fb6752c16e21d
#. default-sha256: e42cbd5cf60d49a5898619b288aff8bfe965698fd9fb533bde3d99566d0c05e8
msgctxt "omake:omake_C86A283F_EF5F_4910_9E27_FEEE835E9822"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In some ways, you could call the first four chapters an extended prologue."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫从某种意义上来说，⟪k:3⟫前四章是一个特别长的序章呢。"

#: omake:omake_04EFEC16_E072_4AAB_8F7F_27F92146FDB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 919b43aca253b7046c4ecbd284637a23067c6052694a7bf5f5c2d368458acb91
#. default-sha256: 024c5f8412507910e071eebdfc782cc3a4c457a9fb1ecf80cd1eac4956018c42
msgctxt "omake:omake_04EFEC16_E072_4AAB_8F7F_27F92146FDB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aww! What about me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫咦咦，⟪k:2⟫为什么！"

#: omake:omake_FAE92C38_A7AE_47BC_988B_8D0A204B48A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6da2318a90f8eb9c5d13cf247895d0bd9fff29ac3115eaa18bea6c4b6e3ddd4f
#. default-sha256: 265241a0f2573d104e108395de59c90a572d8f6c0211c3c7ddd08ac8f12d2cc4
msgctxt "omake:omake_FAE92C38_A7AE_47BC_988B_8D0A204B48A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because with you around, he turns into a lovesick, airheaded dope. ⟪k:3⟫He’s about "
"as useful to me as a wet paper sack full of potatoes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫只要在吉赛儿身边，⟪k:3⟫他就只是个色色的懒散汉。⟪k:4⟫松懈得让人看不下去。"

#: omake:omake_01DFD587_996F_4535_AD66_8069416148E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95415544f4ce86e726f7d9bafd09883994b930632b34a7828e20050fe8d4737a
#. default-sha256: 125b086f40a8ee78341c977e535609d52ecf9bb657e149c5fe3327120029ed27
msgctxt "omake:omake_01DFD587_996F_4535_AD66_8069416148E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Absolutely not.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You spoil him—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫in more ways than one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不行，因为你马上就会惯着他。"

#: omake:omake_00458DC6_24DD_49A1_9A44_7913F792FA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 830c7235a315815b53fb40055b6180852b78c6ebdffe60b2248733aeeff45002
#. default-sha256: f2fdb37beb4bbde6cbcc37ffd8f818647be3d73b15ef728528fcd3b1320982c8
msgctxt "omake:omake_00458DC6_24DD_49A1_9A44_7913F792FA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What are we going to do, though?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫可是，⟪k:2⟫离开这间屋子去干什么……？"

#: omake:omake_0A87396A_6CA3_4EBB_A1DC_2E718908DE9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b7e2b4d941e07a87b0d51740771126ff8786d85ef00628b3458f6403c0913bc
#. default-sha256: 92b0bca472d6e2d73e66f5031cab1c280f4d6706fe06e7fd00fb6fdb36d5103d
msgctxt "omake:omake_0A87396A_6CA3_4EBB_A1DC_2E718908DE9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I seem to recall plenty of faffing about in the main game anyway;⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫why "
"don’t we do something we ⟪k:5⟫couldn’t⟪k:6⟫ do there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫可是本篇已经肆意评价过了，⟪k:2⟫幕后是不是应该换个新鲜的做法？"

#: omake:omake_3270FD07_2CA5_4EB1_A3EC_A58FAF8F9135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ece800ed950ea2284c91c4760d67a2d5aea81a6d5a6b16dc386c72ce639335e
#. default-sha256: 6752712c0ce2d6e921d17a80824b29bd8b408cf46ca5985b1a9bbb041dd092e3
msgctxt "omake:omake_3270FD07_2CA5_4EB1_A3EC_A58FAF8F9135"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ve got profiles and other miscellaneous notes from the creators about each of the "
"characters. ⟪k:2⟫I thought they might come in handy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫里面暴露了制作者们对各角色的设定。⟪k:2⟫拿上这个应该不错吧。"

#: omake:omake_D9720B49_BE4B_4233_AD85_F5EE3AB8852A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c6498b6d68b750ef35c5bd65406ee6b5bc0a4f23a975e841984b5cce8cc3709
#. default-sha256: 22b1c1daee2c1fcfa31678ed678d2c64941e15956744a334b9b59c609efec1dd
msgctxt "omake:omake_D9720B49_BE4B_4233_AD85_F5EE3AB8852A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can see them being useful, yes...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but why exactly do you ⟪k:4⟫have⟪k:5⟫ "
"those?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……先不说好不好……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫为什么你会有那种东西……？"

#: omake:omake_B908C0B0_A59E_4A40_A466_5B4855F5E803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5107a1f13d6b07f80b54c59eeeefcff5ee7f60ce6d252e9a7bdd105e7722303
#. default-sha256: af1545ce9eadd2c8b4c6898b2b4cbc8b6b56c797737b8026134560794ad5b35f
msgctxt "omake:omake_B908C0B0_A59E_4A40_A466_5B4855F5E803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I’d rather pretend those miniaturized ⟪k:2⟫things⟪k:3⟫ were not actually us...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（虽然不想把那群小家伙当成我们……）"

#: omake:omake_0410FEE1_869D_46D3_9374_1966D808C9F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c9668c0d3f411930fdba6dd646a0a11bfc0cda62e371fedbb408c5bbf0fc20a
#. default-sha256: aaec36e7ebf01a03e074affbc091e0cfc12da3b720b50f75e73889fc96a12524
msgctxt "omake:omake_0410FEE1_869D_46D3_9374_1966D808C9F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hand over the cue cards."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那演出脚本就借我看看吧。"

#: omake:omake_4043095C_4868_46C9_9D44_88A2E7235295
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3707591617d3de14bec28758120bb13f741636a7cdc28dbb396d8f31738912d8
#. default-sha256: e76edc1abe3a5db108a4a01c3cbd6da7fe60b6dfaf7599814b4194ab8e8e5958
msgctxt "omake:omake_4043095C_4868_46C9_9D44_88A2E7235295"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The second chapter was pretty crazy too!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When we found out about, ⟪k:5⟫"
"uh, ⟪k:6⟫Ukulele, that was it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫第二章的那人也很厉害啊，⟪k:3⟫就是那位心正！"

#: omake:omake_FB1C8C58_BDE7_4C25_A96D_8C079BBFE140
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbaa669c1f40455d4548a486963ba02beb949dcce80a91a24d1f4f78f4cd9041
#. default-sha256: 733ae1c921c4017a841e6afb8f3f23e75e73d4aa882945ee163c3207b32db7ee
msgctxt "omake:omake_FB1C8C58_BDE7_4C25_A96D_8C079BBFE140"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Ahaha.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Chapter three was something else too.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My impression of "
"Jacopo and Maria had completely turned around by the end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫啊、⟪k:1⟫啊哈哈。⟪k:2⟫第三章也逆转了，⟪k:3⟫雅各布和玛利亚给人的印象最后也完全颠倒了。"

#: omake:omake_54FAF5B0_AB1F_4D4B_8DD6_4EB27BAB9EC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0de39fdbc1a5d2c95fa8f3fef06e09848414f73d372073295fc08ae01aace75
#. default-sha256: 5f5d6c3d335b818fae12d5d867da8a13b03a12b8aa2b83491aea2f555d9289f1
msgctxt "omake:omake_54FAF5B0_AB1F_4D4B_8DD6_4EB27BAB9EC3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Piles of human garbage, the three of them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫说来也真是的，⟪k:1⟫那三人组简直渣得不像话。"

#: omake:omake_4A3B06DA_3318_4B85_897A_EFAC99CB3699
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b66a340a6cc6b2b1f1998a7128f33e52cb8b6743e8ed3e703fde0dd836177abf
#. default-sha256: bac8a6f6d267265c7db4894887dc9c1ecbcc1f4e3a9ddec921ff14241236e2d5
msgctxt "omake:omake_4A3B06DA_3318_4B85_897A_EFAC99CB3699"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫..................⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Wha?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………咦。"

#: omake:omake_AF459C50_7428_4E06_B52B_E61DDFA1FC42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5d10b6c646b087cb9928631455b6410ee6063a41cad61715d692fc9fb861195
#. default-sha256: 9e570f4bbac8adaae4ca2b4b0b8cbe1dfc358742155800eed5f2b5a626edd508
msgctxt "omake:omake_AF459C50_7428_4E06_B52B_E61DDFA1FC42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I, ⟪k:2⟫um... ⟪k:3⟫wasn’t expecting something so...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫flattering to come out of "
"your mouth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不是……⟪k:2⟫没想到会用这么正面的词形容我……"

#: omake:omake_015D16D7_B9C9_4D89_A4A6_0559A858ADB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae964a421e2e6bd50a3afa39d3ce57f7f7077b8a162067d37c2f4afc8d57e54a
#. default-sha256: ec295e37053cf933dcd6b5faef60eb84cd3f566635d7e4dc801d2b326ef336f6
msgctxt "omake:omake_015D16D7_B9C9_4D89_A4A6_0559A858ADB1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s true.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Putting a knife to a woman’s neck isn’t very righteous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫是啊，⟪k:3⟫用匕首对着女孩子也太过分了。"

#: omake:omake_C5E64966_43BC_4099_8D0D_6DA0BD579942
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56ac293fa61308a54375bd66b8bd1989ada8b89941d51f19cfaf523e72e8d4d9
#. default-sha256: 5260768d2116b83c4c58b94420b2b4291b811da44d94f250df2d08103034a2eb
msgctxt "omake:omake_C5E64966_43BC_4099_8D0D_6DA0BD579942"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Anyway. While those are the core aspects of your character, they got buried over "
"the course of the abuse and misfortune you suffered throughout the story."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫嗯，⟪k:3⟫虽然你的本性善良，⟪k:4⟫但境遇太悲惨，⟪k:5⟫没机会体现出来。"

#: omake:omake_EF314AA7_C3E8_4D12_87F4_B33DAA747E3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d33c2cad05c02ec3c8887ece88e5db980e39e56e64b97c7b7ffc547d7369613d
#. default-sha256: 603aafbf750f93a13402712fc2848754ec21b1aa64cbcb5a5e1c78b2c41757d3
msgctxt "omake:omake_EF314AA7_C3E8_4D12_87F4_B33DAA747E3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How all the promotional material portrays me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫官方对我的待遇。"

#: omake:omake_1BE9E555_DCC5_4A99_AF04_16EBAFE32490
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a079fa219e13edaf53c300028dd1eea7a96c7c23a483d765cfb10e3b615652a
#. default-sha256: 47f7bb44312b87d62680802ec2e3027d972cea4e648def2adc5a5d1e685c6ab9
msgctxt "omake:omake_1BE9E555_DCC5_4A99_AF04_16EBAFE32490"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well, it ⟪k:3⟫was⟪k:4⟫ the demo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I’m sure they just didn’t want to spoil "
"the surprise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫肯定是因为，⟪k:3⟫你的「率直」用错了方向。"

#: omake:omake_E1027F9E_3ADF_4690_B6BE_387E9AD7ACEC
